sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Internal as Pengguna Internal
    participant Sistem as Sistem (Submission Controller)
    participant Layanan as Layanan (Submission Service)

    Internal->>Sistem: Mengirim Status Baru (Contoh: APPROVED)
    Sistem->>Sistem: Validasi Ketersediaan Input Status
    
    alt Status Kosong
        Sistem-->>Internal: Pesan Penolakan (Error 400 - Bad Request)
    else Status Valid
        Sistem->>Layanan: Perbarui Status Internal (updateInternalStatus)
        Layanan-->>Sistem: Mengembalikan Data Pengajuan Terkini
        Sistem-->>Internal: Konfirmasi Status Berhasil Diperbarui
    end
